## Legacy reference only.
## The Compose stack now generates `/data/users.acl` at runtime from environment variables
## via `deployment/redis_init/init_redis.sh`.
##
## Example ACL layout:
## user default off
## user admin on #<sha256-password-hash> ~* +@all
## user gochat_app on #<sha256-password-hash> ~* +@all
